@startuml
[*] --> LoggedIn
LoggedIn --> MyBooksList : Click "My Books" tab
MyBooksList --> MarkAsRead : Mark as read
MyBooksList --> MarkAsUnread : Mark as unread
MyBooksList --> AddNewBook : Click "Add Book"
MyBooksList --> ReceiveRecommendations : View recommendations
MarkAsRead --> MyBooksList : Return to list
MarkAsUnread --> MyBooksList : Return to list
AddNewBook --> MyBooksList : Save book
ReceiveRecommendations --> MyBooksList : Return to list
MyBooksList --> [*] : Logout
@enduml
